---
<div class="bg-slate-900 rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-12 text-center text-white my-12 shadow-xl mx-4 sm:mx-6 lg:mx-8">
  <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-4">订阅我们的更新</h3>
  <p class="text-slate-400 mb-8 max-w-xl mx-auto">获取最新的深度评测和使用教程，绝不发送垃圾邮件。</p>
  <form class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row max-w-md mx-auto gap-4" onsubmit="event.preventDefault();">
    <input 
      type="email" 
      placeholder="输入您的邮箱地址" 
      class="flex-1 px-4 py-3 rounded-lg bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-white focus:outline-none focus:border-primary-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-primary-500"
      required
    />
    <button type="submit" class="btn-primary py-3">
      立即订阅
    </button>
  </form>
</div>
